### 1. Passed Test Cases (Good and Referable)

1. **`test_user_login`**
   - **Pseudocode**:
     ```plaintext
     CLASS UserManager
         FUNCTION login(username, password)
             RETURN True IF username exists and password matches
     END CLASS

     FUNCTION login
         IF request method is POST THEN
             username = get input from form
             password = get input from form
             IF user_manager.login(username, password) THEN
                 SET session username
                 REDIRECT to home
             END IF
         END IF
         RETURN render_template('login.html')
     ```

2. **`test_user_registration`**
   - **Pseudocode**:
     ```plaintext
     CLASS UserManager
         FUNCTION register(username, password)
             IF username exists in users THEN
                 RETURN False
             END IF
             OPEN file for appending
                 WRITE username and password
             CLOSE file
             ADD username to users
             RETURN True
     END CLASS

     FUNCTION registration
         IF request method is POST THEN
             username = get input from form
             password = get input from form
             IF user_manager.register(username, password) THEN
                 REDIRECT to login
             END IF
         END IF
         RETURN render_template('registration.html')
     ```

3. **`test_navigating_home_page_after_login`**
